      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The talk will introduce the Gnome Development Platform to new developers.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The talk will cover the components and technologies that are available, how they are related and how to get started using them.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The session will leave time for questions.&#xA;The goal is to use the feedback to improve the offered platform documentation.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
